WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Rep: What's driving the urgency on this for you?

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:13.000
CISO: Our board is asking hard questions after two of our competitors got hit
with ransomware this year. One of them was down for almost two weeks and lost
customers over it. We can't have that happen here.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.000
Rep: Is there a compliance angle too?

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:25.000
CISO: Yes — our next audit cycle requires us to show continuous endpoint
monitoring, and right now we'd fail that outright. If we get flagged, the
fines alone would be significant, on top of the reputational hit.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.000
Rep: Any sense of what a breach would cost you today?

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:36.000
CISO: Our insurer used an industry figure of around 4.5 million as the
expected cost of a serious incident, and honestly that tracks with what we've
seen in similar-sized companies in our industry.
